built: grid { What, Where, Tests; "Rename: Id field, right-click, F2", "rename.ts, text-rename.ts, CodeRename.tsx", rename.spec.js; Placed patterns keep their connections, patternLines in patterns.ts, code-patterns.spec.js; 101 code patterns in four groups, code-patterns.ts, code-patterns.spec.js; Patterns drag in from the palette, "palette.ts, Stage.tsx", code-patterns.spec.js; "Delete a container, its contents go too", selection.ts deleteShapes, code-patterns.spec.js; "Container backdrops: bg=, bgfill=", containers.ts, containers.spec.js; Sequences inside a container, checkSequences in language.ts, planning.spec.js; Properties edits apply on a canvas click, pointer.ts, rename.spec.js; Chart tests skip the backdrop, render.ts data-bg, "wireframe, more-charts"; Every pattern described and animated, "Pattern.animation, addSteps in language.ts", pattern-animation.spec.js; "Deleting shapes tidies the @animation block", syncFromModel in sync.ts, pattern-animation.spec.js } @ 15,15 267x96

note: callout "Rename shares one helper with patterns: renameInLine in flow/language.ts rewrites a\nshape's own id, [in=] and both ends of its connections, and nothing in quotes or comments." @ 15,118 170x14

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
