r1: sticky "Rename from the canvas\n\nRight-click a shape:\nRename, the same box and\nrenameShape as the text" 58x28 [in=small]
r2: sticky "Undo inside the text pane\n\nCtrl+Z while typing there is\nthe textarea's own undo,\nwhich a rename wipes; the\napp's undo works from the\ncanvas" 58x34 [in=small]
r3: sticky "Implicit shapes\n\nAn id only named by\nconnections renames fine;\nalso offer 'declare it'" 58x26 [in=small]

later: container "With other features" [flow=column gap=3 in=rename]
r4: sticky "Links (links-design.flow)\n\nlink=\"page#id\" must follow\na rename: extend\nrenameInLine, the one place\nids are rewritten" 58x32 [in=later]
r5: sticky "Find and replace\n(find-design.flow)\n\nReplacing an id goes\nthrough renameShape" 58x30 [in=later]
r6: sticky "Includes (include-design)\n\nctx.web ids: renaming web\nin the included file can't\nreach files that include it" 58x30 [in=later]

